# November 26, 2026: Washington, District of Columbia, region dc. Leads from one walking-tour video of the city's
# grand old buildings; the video was only a tip, and every fact below comes from a source opened when this was written:
# Wikipedia articles (each place's own), the Capitol Visitor Center's hours page, the Library of Congress visit page,
# the Smithsonian American Art Museum's visit pages (main building and Renwick Gallery), the Scottish Rite's House of the
# Temple tours page and Union Station's hours page. The pages of the DAR, the Organization of American States and the
# National Postal Museum refused to open, so their hours were not read.
